<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Edit Property - FUTB Housing</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head>
<body>
<nav class="navbar"><div class="container nav-inner"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">F</span> FUTB <em>Housing</em></a><ul><li><a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a></li><li><a href="/logout">Logout</a></li></ul></div></nav>
<main class="container auth-shell"><span class="eyebrow">LANDLORD STUDIO</span><h2>Edit property</h2><p>Changes send the listing back for verification.</p><form method="POST" action="/property/<%= property._id %>/edit"><label class="form-label" for="title">Property title</label><input id="title" name="title" value="<%= property.title %>" required><label class="form-label" for="description">Description</label><textarea id="description" name="description" rows="5" required><%= property.description %></textarea><label class="form-label" for="price">Monthly price</label><input id="price" type="number" name="price" value="<%= property.price %>" required><label class="form-label" for="location">Area</label><input id="location" name="location" value="<%= property.location %>" required><label class="form-label" for="address">Street address</label><input id="address" name="address" value="<%= property.address %>" required><label class="form-label" for="amenities">Amenities</label><input id="amenities" name="amenities" value="<%= property.amenities.join(', ') %>"><button class="btn" type="submit">Save changes</button></form><a href="/dashboard">Back to dashboard</a></main>
</body></html>
